[engl]
{100}{}{Killian}
{200}{}{You see Killian.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> get_stuff_from_safe]}
{2000}{}{You moved against Gizmo without evidence. Y'know, he wasn't on the up-and-up, but
neither are you. Go see Lars.}
{2010}{}{[Done.]}
{3000}{}{Well, congratulations. You just earned yourself a night in a cell. Boys . . .}
{3010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx1]}
{4000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killianx1']}
{4010}{}{Right . . . I don't think so.}
{4020}{}{Nu-uhh?}
{4030}{}{All right, I'll come along quietly.}
{5000}{}{Now what the Uncle Sam-hell do you think you're doing here?}
{5010}{}{Uh . . . I got lost?}
{5020}{}{Oh, this is your place?}
{5030}{}{Well . . . I broke in.}
{6000}{}{Uh, no. You got stupid. Get out of here!}
{6010}{}{Who's going to make me? You? Don't make me laugh . . .}
{6020}{}{Okay. Sorry about the inconvenience.}
{7000}{}{You're damn straight this is my place! Now get the hell out before I make your head a
wall decoration!}
{7010}{}{You? Wake up, pal, you're still dreaming.}
{7020}{}{Okay, okay, I'm going.}
{8000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian32a']}
{8010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> DownReactLevel]}
{8020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx2]}
{9000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'DownReactLevel']}
{9010}{}{[Done.]}
{10000}{}{An honest thief. Hmpf. Well, I'm still gonna have to take you in. Come along quietly and
you won't get hurt.}
{10010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx1]}
{11000}{}{It's obvious your mama didn't teach you manners. Am I gonna have to?}
{11010}{}{[Done.]}
{12000}{}{You leaving so soon? Better pay first.}
{12010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx]}
{13000}{}{This is not something I take as a joke. Now. Pay up.}
{13010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx]}
{14000}{}{All right. Fine. Let's see if a night in the locker will cool you off a bit.}
{14010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx1]}
{15000}{}{Listen. Thanks for saving my life. It's a mighty brave thing to do. Looks like we got
ourselves a situation here. I know Gizmo's behind this, but I need proof. You interested
in helpin'?}
{15010}{}{Me? What do you need me for?}
{15020}{}{Can't you get someone else? I'm kinda busy . . .}
{15030}{}{I'm in.}
{15040}{}{Uh-huh.}
{15050}{}{Nuh-uh.}
{16000}{}{Now, if I get proof, the people of Junktown will kick him out. Way I figure it, you need
to either plant a bug at his place or wear a wire and get him to confess to you. Can you
handle that?}
{16010}{}{Ummm . . . no. Getting involved in other people's problems never works out.}
{16020}{}{Whoa. Sounds kinda dangerous . . .}
{16030}{}{What do I get in return?}
{17000}{}{Well, damn. That's too bad. But, you know, I'm gonna have to lock you up until this
thing's done. Can't risk Gizmo finding out. Sorry.}
{17010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx1]}
{18000}{}{I'm not gonna lie to you, it will be dangerous. But I'll owe you one, and Killian
Darkwater always pays his debts.}
{18010}{}{You sure you can't find someone else?}
{18020}{}{I don't think so. Sounds too dangerous to me.}
{18030}{}{What do you mean, 'pays his debts.'}
{19000}{}{It'll work best if it's you. Gizmo doesn't know you, so he might trust you. Or, at least
he'll have a hard time blaming me. Either way, you're the best person for the job.}
{19010}{}{Pass. Getting killed doesn't seem like a fun thing for me.}
{19020}{}{What do I get out of this?}
{19030}{}{Fair enough, I'll do it.}
{20000}{}{I'll tell you what. Anything in the store, even the most expensive, it's yours. No
charge. If it's a gun, I'll give you all the ammo you can carry. Does that sound fair?}
{20010}{}{Not even close. I'm not risking my neck for that.}
{20020}{}{Yeah. I'll do it.}
{21000}{}{All right, I owe you. Here's the bug and the wire tap. You let me know when it's done.
And good luck.}
{21010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx4]}
{22000}{}{You have to wear a recorder and tape Gizmo confessing, or plant this wire tap in his
office. Either way, and we got him.}
{22010}{}{What do I have to do to help you get rid of Gizmo?}
{23000}{}{So, did you get the evidence?}
{23010}{}{Not yet. But I will, believe me!}
{23020}{}{Nuh-uh.}
{23030}{}{I sure did.}
{23040}{}{Uh-huh.}
{24000}{}{Well, he's not going to come here and confess! You shouldn't even be seen with me until
this is done. Now go.}
{24010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx]}
{25000}{}{Which, bug or tape?}
{25010}{}{The bug.}
{25020}{}{Nu-uhh?}
{25030}{}{The confession.}
{26000}{}{Great! Let me make sure it's working.}
{26010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> soundcheck]}
{27000}{}{Loud and clear. We're going to get him. In the mean time, we've got some business . . .}
{27010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian_give_stuff]}
{28000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian_give_stuff']}
{28010}{}{No thanks. Knowing that Gizmo's going to get his due is thanks enough.}
{28020}{}{Nuh-uh.}
{28030}{}{I'll take a shotgun and shells.}
{28040}{}{I'll take a suit of leather armor.}
{28050}{}{I'll take a doctor's medical kit.}
{28060}{}{I'll take all the stimpaks you can spare.}
{29000}{}{Well, thanks again. Oh, listen, I'm gonna take the guards and run Gizmo and his cronies
out of town. I could use another gun. You up for it? Might be good for a laugh.}
{29010}{}{Sure. It'll be worth it just to see him try to walk more than ten feet.}
{29020}{}{Uh-huh.}
{29030}{}{Kinda depends on what you're willing to give me.}
{29040}{}{Again? I don't think so. I've got way too much stuff going on.}
{29050}{}{Nuh-uh.}
{30000}{}{Go to Lars at the guard station. He'll fill you in. And listen, this town owes you . . .
a lot.}
{30010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx]}
{31000}{}{Well, I can pay you the standard rate for mercenary work, 500 caps.}
{31010}{}{Done.}
{31020}{}{Sorry, not enough.}
{32000}{}{Good enough. Go see Lars, he'll give you the details.}
{32010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx]}
{33000}{}{Listen, that's all I'm offering. Thanks for getting the evidence, but I'm not going to
beg for your services.}
{33010}{}{All right, I'll do it for that fee.}
{33020}{}{Oh, well. See ya around.}
{34000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian63a']}
{34010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> DownReactLevel]}
{34020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian64]}
{35000}{}{Good luck in your travels. Now if you'll excuse me, I have a fat ass to move.}
{35010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killianx]}
{36000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian_give_shotgun']}
{36010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian59]}
{37000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian_give_armor']}
{37010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian59]}
{38000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian_give_doctor_bag']}
{38010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian59]}
{39000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian_give_stimpaks']}
{39010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian59]}
{40000}{}{Let's hear it.}
{40010}{}{What do I have to do to help you get rid of Gizmo?}
{41000}{}{That's the first time I've been happy to hear his voice. Thanks, friend. Now, time for
you and me to take care of the other business.}
{41010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian_give_stuff]}
{42000}{}{Well, howdy! What can I do for you today?}
{42010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}
{43000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'killian00']}
{43010}{}{I'd better go.}
{43020}{}{Nu-uhh?}
{43030}{}{Who are you?}
{43040}{}{How about telling me a bit about this town?}
{43050}{}{What's there to do around here?}
{43060}{}{I want to buy something.}
{43070}{}{Do you own this store?}
{43080}{}{What do I have to do to help you get rid of Gizmo?}
{43090}{}{What do you know about this Gizmo character?}
{44000}{}{You want to buy something, friend?}
{44010}{}{[Done.]}
{45000}{}{The name's Killian. Killian Darkwater. I'm the mayor of this fine town. And who might
you be?
---
I'm
---
.
---
My name is
---
. I come from up north.}
{45010}{}{What's it to you?}
{46000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian02a']}
{46010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> DownReactLevel]}
{46020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian16]}
{47000}{}{Oh, you obviously have me confused with someone who has to take your lip. Why don't you
come back when your mama teaches you some manners.}
{47010}{}{[Done.]}
{48000}{}{Well, Junktown's not much, but it's home. Mostly we trade with people or let 'em forget
their troubles for a bit. Of course, we have our share of problems.}
{48010}{}{What other cities are around here?}
{48020}{}{Problems?}
{48030}{}{What's there to do in this town?}
{48040}{}{Thanks.}
{49000}{}{Well, travelers tell me there's a bunch of crazies up north called the Vipers. Another
group of yahoos out east called the Khans. Neither one of them likely to invite you to
supper as anything but the main course, if you know what I mean.}
{49010}{}{Thanks.}
{49020}{}{What else is outside Junktown?}
{50000}{}{Well, ya got the Hub southwest. Don't go south, though. That'd be Necropolis; the, uh .
. . climate's bad there, rain or shine. If you understand what I'm saying.}
{50010}{}{I'd better be going now.}
{50020}{}{Well, thanks for the information. Can I ask you a few more questions?}
{50030}{}{You just know everything, don't you?}
{51000}{}{Hell, why not. Ask away, friend.
---
Yeah, okay. But make it quick, I got work to do.}
{51010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}
{52000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian09a']}
{52010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian04]}
{52020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> DownReactLevel]}
{53000}{}{Yeah, if you say so. So what do you need?}
{53010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}
{54000}{}{From outside, we've had the occasional to-do with the Khans. But they've been pretty
quiet lately. Inside, trouble's been from the Skulz. And I hear of some strange things
happening down by the Hub, but they haven't affected us yet, knock on my mother-in-law's
head.}
{54010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}
{55000}{}{Oh, we got tons to do. The Skum Pitt's on the east side, by the entrance. Great drinkin'
place. Gizmo's is near there. And if you're hurtin', Doc Morbid's your man.}
{55010}{}{Thanks.}
{55020}{}{That's all there is to do around here?}
{56000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian13b']}
{56010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}
{57000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian13a']}
{57010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> DownReactLevel]}
{57020}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Killian14]}
{58000}{}{Well, if we're too fast for ya, just pass on by, pal. It is pal, ain't it?}
{58010}{}{Better than nothing, I guess.}
{58020}{}{Then there won't be anything exciting in town.}
{59000}{}{By a damn sight.}
{59010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}
{60000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian11a']}
{60010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}
{61000}{}{Well that's a damn fine coincidence! That's what this store's here for! We got about
everything you can need. Let me show you some things over here . . .}
{61010}{}{What do I have to do to help you get rid of Gizmo?}
{62000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'Killian_barter']}
{62010}{}{Nu-uhh?}
{63000}{}{You bet. May not be as big as some in the Hub, but people usually find what they're
looking for. Take a look around . . .}
{63010}{}{[Done.]}
{64000}{}{You have to wear a recorder and tape Gizmo confessing, or plant this wire tap in his
office. Either way, and we got him.}
{64010}{}{[Done.]}
{65000}{}{Gizmo owns the casino. Named it after himself. Be very careful around him.}
{65010}{}{Okay.}
{65020}{}{Yeah, he's dangerous. I'm here to kill you for him.}
{65030}{}{I'll say . . . that fat slob just tried to hire me to kill you. Why don't you do
something about him?}
{66000}{}{You again. What do you want now?}
{66010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}
{67000}{}{Welcome to Junktown, stranger. What can I help you with?@@Hello, darlin'. What can I get ya?@@What do you want?@@Can I help you?}
{67010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> killian00]}

